      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "もしそうじゃなかったら\r\n追加オプションで特別料金を請求するところだった。",
        "official_en": "I was about to charge you a fee for the extra stop.",
        "real_en": "If it hadn't been on the way, I would've charged you an extra fee for the optional detour."
